{"_v":1,"id":"she-loves-me-1994","bd":{"positive":6,"mixed":0,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.wsj.com/articles/she-loves-me-the-sweet-scent-of-perfection-1458261001","q":"Perfection needs no commentary, so I'll make it short and sweet: Theatre Company's revival of 'She Loves Me' is ideal."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/laura-benanti-zachary-levi-she-875850","q":"Everything falls into place in this richly satisfying production, which had me smiling from beginning to end."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":87,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/she-loves-me-review-laura-benanti-zachary-levi-delight-1.11583747","q":"There is cause for celebration."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out New York","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/she-loves-me","q":"The Roundabout gets so much right in a splendid, joy-stuffed production."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"http://www.nydailynews.com/entertainment/theater-arts/roundabout-loves-lovable-article-1.2567880","q":"Broadway's bewitching new 'She Loves Me' is as sweet and exhilarating as a first kiss."},{"cn":"Robert Hofler","o":"TheWrap","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://www.thewrap.com/she-loves-me-broadway-review-zachary-levi-laura-benanti-musical/","q":"They're as charming as Tom Hanks and Meg Ryan, those 'You've Got Mail' stars, and they can also sing."}],"au":{"score":83,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":83,"c":225,"sr":4.2}}},"pd":"1993-06-10","ca":[{"n":"Tommy Tune","r":"Performer"},{"n":"Robert Fowler","r":"Performer"},{"n":"Frantz G. Hall","r":"Performer"}]}